22
00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:02,750
On the phone, the corrected story follows the fan.

23
00:01:03,514 --> 00:01:06,130
Same evidence, a simpler explanation.

24
00:01:06,780 --> 00:01:13,500
Captions, voice, color-safe shapes, and a transcript make that story easier to follow.

25
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:16,776
Publish prepares one checked source for different screens.

26
00:01:17,336 --> 00:01:20,160
Preparation and confirmed delivery remain distinct.

27
